@host = http://localhost:4174

### Health check
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Register a student
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "displayName": "Học viên Demo",
  "password": "MatKhau123!"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "MatKhau123!"
}

### Current profile
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Student-only endpoint
GET {{host}}/api/student/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Teacher endpoint (expect 403 with a student token)
GET {{host}}/api/teacher/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Admin endpoint (expect 403 with a student token)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
